  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Parliamentarians for Flobal Action (PGA), parlamentariker f&#xf6;r globalt deltagande och utveckling &#xe4;r ett n&#xe4;tverk best&#xe5;nde av nu valda ocvh    sittande riksdagm&#xe4;n fr&#xe5;n ca 130 l&#xe4;nder (medlemskap p&#xe5; ca 1000 st.).   De arbetar med att tackla fr&#xe5;gor av internationell betydelse. Syftet  &#xe4;r att att verka f&#xf6;r fred, demokrati, r&#xe4;ttsstatens principer,         m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter samt h&#xe5;llbar utveckling.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Parliamentarians for Global Action (PGA) is an international network  of legislators with a membership of approx. 1000 MPs from 130         countries globally. They are all elected an in office currently.      Their aim is to tackle issues of international importance. The        overall objectives of PGA&apos;s programmes are to promote peace,          democracy, rule of law, human rights and sustianble development</narrative>
  </description>
